  designNotes: 'A tank that asks questions: each Dawn the enemy creature facing it
    is Revealed for the Day (the Socratic method: its plans show). No damage, which
    Mind can''t deal; it just stands there, hard to kill, and makes the creature
    in front of it explain itself.'
  artDescription: Socrates in a white toga, bald with a big beard, cornering a sweating
    man in a business suit against a marble column with one raised finger, a huge
    question mark in his speech bubble, a cup of hemlock waiting on a pedestal behind.
